## Who referred you, and notes on your request (release 50)

1. On the request form, under **Who referred you?**, type 3 letters of the person''s name, or of the business that sent you. Choose them from the list: they are credited for your booking. A code from their flyer or card still works typed as is.
2. Once the request is sent, open it from your account. Under **Notes to our team**, write a flight number, a question or a change of plan and press **Add the note**. Our team sees it on your request right away.
3. A car marked as an example on the site is not a real car. A request for it still reaches our team, who offer you a real car like it for the same dates.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Every booking starts as a request. A person checks the car and the price, then sends you an offer. Nothing is charged until you approve, sign and pay.</p><ol class="gd-flow"><li><b>1</b><span>Request</span><em>You pick a car and dates</em></li><li><b>2</b><span>Offer</span><em>We confirm the price</em></li><li><b>3</b><span>Sign</span><em>The rental agreement</em></li><li><b>4</b><span>Pay</span><em>Your card is authorized</em></li><li><b>5</b><span>Verify</span><em>Licence, selfie, coverage</em></li><li><b>6</b><span>Pick up</span><em>We hand over the keys</em></li></ol><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-find-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a car</h2><p class="gd-p">Start on carmacars.ca. You do not need to sign in to look around.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Go to <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca</span> and press <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Add your pickup and return dates. The list then shows the cars that are free and what the whole trip costs.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Narrow the list with Filters: type, seats, transmission and daily rate.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Open a car to see its photos, rates, what is included and its own calendar. Its car code (like CC-7F3A) is under the price: quote it when you call or chat with us, and we know the car at once.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/cars</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/880"><img src="/guides/img/public-02-cars-desktop-b6cd4fb8.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="880"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:86.1%;top:4%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:11.1%;top:56.8%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3%;top:82.3%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:34%;top:87.5%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-choose-your-dates-on-the-car-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Choose your dates on the car page</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under Dates and price, tap your pickup date, then your return date. Hatched days are already booked.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Pickup time and the Return time.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Want it brought to you? Tick <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to me</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Pick it up from me at the end</b>. Open Add-ons to add a baby seat, flowers, a full tank and more.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Check Your estimate, then press <b class="gd-ui">Request to book</b>. The add-ons you chose come with you.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/cars/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1120/760"><img src="/guides/img/public-03-car-page-desktop-73be4d63.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1120" height="760"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:24.4%;top:39.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.9%;top:68.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3%;top:76.2%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:97%;top:50%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>A request does not hold the car. The car is booked only once you approve the offer, sign and pay.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-send-your-request" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Send your request</h2><p class="gd-p">The request has five short steps. Your answers are saved as you go, so you can come back.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Step 1, Dates and delivery: check the car and tap your dates in the calendar.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Set the Pickup time and Return time. Any time, day or night, with at least 2 hours of notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your request, on the right, shows the estimated total as you go.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/1002"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-63a3738b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="1002"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:9.2%;top:67.1%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.3%;top:91%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91.1%;top:54.7%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="4"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Choose where you get the car: <b class="gd-ui">At our location</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to an address</b> or <b class="gd-ui">At the airport</b>. Then choose where you return it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to driver details</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/942"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-befba4f6.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="942"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:5.3%;top:26.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:93.3%" aria-hidden="true">5</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="6"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Step 2, The driver: fill in your first and last name, email, mobile number and date of birth. Signed in? They are filled in from your profile, with your licence class and how we reach you: check them and change anything. A licence that has expired, or an address on file over a year old, is flagged for you to update in your profile.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">Someone else will drive too? Add them under Additional drivers (drivers you named before are one tap away). Each needs a G2 or G licence and signs the agreement.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to licence</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:980/1032"><img src="/guides/img/public-05-book-2-driver-desktop-7b572499.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="980" height="1032"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:21.1%" aria-hidden="true">6</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:64.8%" aria-hidden="true">7</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:55.6%;top:88%" aria-hidden="true">8</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="9"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div class="gd-t">Step 3: choose your Licence class, for example Ontario G2.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div class="gd-t">Choose how the car is covered: Option 1 (OPCF 27 on your own auto policy), Option 2 (rental coverage on your credit card) or Option 3 (the CarmaCars Protection Plan). You can change this any time before pickup. You may also see a link to RentalCoverage, a separate company&#39;s optional product. It is not issued or handled by CarmaCars and does not replace the option you choose here, and we may earn a commission if you buy it, at no extra cost to you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">11</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Booking type: Standard, or Non-refundable for 10% off with no refund.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div class="gd-t">Add anything we should know in the notes, for example a flight number. If a body shop, a tow company or a friend sent you, type their name or the referral code from their card in Did someone refer you?.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">13</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to add-ons</b>. Step 4, Add-ons: tick what you want (see Add-ons below), then press <b class="gd-ui">Review request</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/1452"><img src="/guides/img/public-06-book-3-licence-desktop-22bb144e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="1452"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:11.2%" aria-hidden="true">9</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:32.2%" aria-hidden="true">10</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:50.4%" aria-hidden="true">11</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:66.9%" aria-hidden="true">12</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:71.7%;top:97%" aria-hidden="true">13</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="14"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">14</span><div class="gd-t">Step 5, Check it and send: read every line. Use Edit beside a line to change it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">15</span><div class="gd-t">Tick the box to confirm you are 18 or older and agree to the Terms of use and Privacy policy.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">16</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send request</b>. Nothing is charged and no card is needed.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/492"><img src="/guides/img/public-07-book-4-review-desktop-005f4c0b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="492"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:24.8%" aria-hidden="true">14</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3.9%;top:59.3%" aria-hidden="true">15</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.7%;top:89%" aria-hidden="true">16</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="17"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">17</span><div class="gd-t">The confirmation shows your request number, for example CC-10021. Keep it for any question.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">18</span><div class="gd-t">A person checks the calendar, your dates and your place, usually within 2 hours, day or night. Your offer arrives by email and in Trips.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/755"><img src="/guides/img/public-08-book-5-sent-phone-14a99ccf.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="755"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:32.8%;top:12.3%" aria-hidden="true">17</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-upload-your-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Upload your licence</h2><p class="gd-p">Right after you send your request: the front and back of your licence and a selfie holding it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the Request sent page, press <b class="gd-ui">Upload your licence</b> (or open your booking and press <b class="gd-ui">Your licence</b>).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take each photo with your phone, or choose it. Add the licence number and expiry date if we ask: it must be valid after your return.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Rented with us before? A licence on file that is still valid is used again; nothing to upload.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">We read each photo at once. Blurry or cut off? A message asks you to take it again: do it straight away. The licence details we read are filled in for you: check them and press <b class="gd-ui">These are right</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">Change them</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You need your licence on file to accept the offer.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-the-main-driver-needs-an-ontario-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The main driver needs an Ontario licence</h2><p class="gd-p">The main driver of a booking holds an Ontario licence. Drivers with a licence from elsewhere can drive as extra drivers.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">If your licence is not from Ontario, your booking shows: &quot;The main driver needs an Ontario licence. Add a driver with an Ontario licence as the main driver. You&#39;ll stay on the booking as an extra driver.&quot;</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Add main driver</b>. Enter their name, email, mobile and date of birth, then press <b class="gd-ui">Add main driver</b> again.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Upload the front and back of their licence on the same page. They get their own link to accept and sign the agreement, which names them as the main driver.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">You have an Ontario licence after all? Press <b class="gd-ui">I have an Ontario licence: upload it instead</b> and upload it.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Pickup waits until the main driver has an Ontario licence on file. Your own licence photos stay on the booking: our team still checks them for you as an extra driver.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-add-ons" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add-ons</h2><p class="gd-p">Extras for your trip, such as a baby seat, a child or booster seat, flowers waiting in the car, a chauffeur, an umbrella, a phone charger or a full tank of gas.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the car page (under Add-ons) or in step 4 of the request, tick an add-on or use + and − for seats. The estimate shows the price at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Each add-on shows its price: a trip, a day (with the most for a trip) or an hour. HST is added.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Some need notice, for example flowers need 24 hours. Seats and other items show how many are left for your dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A chauffeur is confirmed by our team in your offer.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">With a full tank of gas (prepaid) you can return the car at any fuel level, with no fuel charge.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-a-discount-code" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A discount code</h2><p class="gd-p">A code from a game on the site, an offer we sent you, or from our team.</p><ul class="gd-ul"><li>On the last step of your request, type it in the promo code box. The price shows the discount at once.</li><li>Every code has a last day. You find it in the email or text that brought the code, and under Your discount codes on Your trips.</li><li>If you have not used a code, we remind you 3 days before its last day and the day before, by email and text as you chose in Profile. A code you won in a game is always reminded; a reminder of an offer comes only if you agreed to get offers, and every email has an Unsubscribe link.</li><li>A code that ended is refused with &quot;This code has expired&quot;. You can still send the request without it.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-ask-in-the-chat" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Ask in the chat</h2><p class="gd-p">The chat button sits in the corner of every page.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press it and write your question: a car, your dates, the price, how booking works. The CarmaCars assistant answers right away with prices from our booking system.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Want a person? Press <b class="gd-ui">Talk to a person</b>. When our team is away, leave your name and email or phone with <b class="gd-ui">Send my details</b> and tick &quot;Email me a copy of this chat&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">End chat</b> when you are done. If you gave your email, a copy of the chat arrives by email.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">A price in the chat is for the dates you asked. Nothing is booked until you approve an offer, sign and pay.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-carry-on-later" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Carry on later</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your name, email and mobile number are saved as you type them, so nothing is lost if you stop. We open an account for you with that email.</li><li>Every form that saves as you type says so under it: &quot;Saved as you type so you can pick up where you left off.&quot;, with a link to the privacy policy.</li><li>On the same phone or computer, open <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/account</span> (or the request page again) to carry on, no password needed.</li><li>We send you one email, &quot;Continue your request&quot;. One tap signs you in, confirms your email and opens your request on any device. You need it before you can accept an offer, sign or pay.</li><li>Already have an account? The form says &quot;You have an account: we sent you a sign-in link&quot;.</li></ul><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Search:</b> the <b class="gd-ui">Search</b> button at the top of every page finds cars, places, help and, once you are signed in, your own bookings by number or car.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-book-instantly-or-request-to-book" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Book instantly or Request to book</h2><p class="gd-p">On the car page and in the booking form you choose how to book. <b class="gd-ui">Request to book</b> (the usual choice) charges nothing: we check the car and send you a pay link or an offer to approve. <b class="gd-ui">Book instantly</b> is for every signed-in renter with a complete profile (name, date of birth, home address, mobile and email), a verified licence and nothing owing, whatever their Rewards tier: you pay now and the car is confirmed at the website price. The cars page has an <b class="gd-ui">Instant booking</b> filter; sample cars and some partner cars are booked by request only. While card payments are paused you pay by Interac e-Transfer instead, and the page says so. If the car cannot be booked at once, your booking comes to us as a request with no charge.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-book-again-instantly-and-coverage-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Book again instantly, and coverage (release 35)</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Rented with us before and verified? Book an available car instantly: sign and pay at once, with no wait for an offer. Your next request goes to the person who helped you last time.</li><li>Pick your credit card from the list to see at once whether it covers the car. If it does not, use your own policy (OPCF 27: send the pink slip and the endorsement page) or the Protection Plan.</li><li>Delivery is priced by distance, with the first kilometres included, shown in your estimate.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-photos-and-filters-release-48" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Photos and filters (release 48)</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>The first photos of a car are studio photos made from that car&#39;s own photos, so every car is shown the same way. The page says so above the photos. Tap <b class="gd-ui">See its real photos</b> to jump to the car&#39;s own photos.</li><li>The <b class="gd-ui">Model</b> filter lists one model per family, for example <b class="gd-ui">CLA-Class</b> or <b class="gd-ui">3 Series</b>. The exact version (such as CLA250 4MATIC) is shown on each car.</li><li>Moving parts of the site, such as cars driving off their cards, can be stopped: choose <b class="gd-ui">Pause animations</b> at the bottom of any page.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-who-referred-you-and-notes-on-your-request-release-50" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Who referred you, and notes on your request (release 50)</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the request form, under <b class="gd-ui">Who referred you?</b>, type 3 letters of the person&#39;s name, or of the business that sent you. Choose them from the list: they are credited for your booking. A code from their flyer or card still works typed as is.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Once the request is sent, open it from your account. Under <b class="gd-ui">Notes to our team</b>, write a flight number, a question or a change of plan and press <b class="gd-ui">Add the note</b>. Our team sees it on your request right away.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">A car marked as an example on the site is not a real car. A request for it still reaches our team, who offer you a real car like it for the same dates.</div></li></ol></div></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'before-pickup', 'chapter', 'sign-and-pay', 'Your booking is confirmed. A few things are left: your licence photos, a selfie and proof of coverage, a signature from each additional driver, and the deposit.

## What we still need from you

While a request or booking is not complete, everything it still needs is in one list, **To do**, under the steps on **Trips** and on the booking: one line for each thing, with its state and a small button. The red button of **Do this next** is always the first thing to do.

| State | What it means |
| --- | --- |
| Needed | Send it: press the button on the line |
| Not accepted | We could not accept what you sent: the reason is on the line, send it again |
| Under review | We have it and a person on our team is checking it |
| Done | Nothing more to do |

The lines are what this booking needs: your licence (front and back) and a selfie for each driver, proof of coverage (not with the Protection Plan), signing and paying, the deposit, each additional driver accepting the terms, your date of birth and your home address. On the booking, the details the agreement needs are filled in right there, under **Your details for the agreement**. Our reminders name the same things.

Each line says exactly what is missing. With your own insurance (OPCF 27) you send two pages: the **pink slip** (the insurance card for your own car) and the **OPCF 27 endorsement page** of your policy. If one is missing, the line says which one ("We have your OPCF 27 endorsement page. Still needed: your pink slip"), and its button opens that upload with the page chosen. Next to each upload is an example picture of the page with the parts that must show circled: your name, the policy number, the dates, the insurer and, on the endorsement page, the OPCF 27 line. Find it in your insurer''s app or website, in your email, or in your car''s glovebox. Put it flat, get all four corners in the photo, and avoid glare.

## Your booking page

Every booking opens with a large photo of your car, its name, the status and a clock: "Pickup in 2 days 4 h", or "Return by Sun 7 PM" while you have the car.

1. Open **Trips**, then your booking. The status is on the photo, for example Confirmed, with your booking number.
2. Under the photo: when and where you pick up and return the car (tap a place to open it in Maps), the kilometres included, the fuel rule and the deposit.
3. **Do this next**, at the top, tells you the one thing still needed, with its red button, for example **Upload documents**, and the time left before pickup. Under it, your steps: done, now (**Your turn**) and later. When nothing is needed it says when and where to pick up the car, with **Add to calendar**.
4. Manage your trip holds **Licence and coverage**, **Extend**, **Ask to change dates**, **Message us**, **Call us**, **Add a driver**, **Documents** and **Cancel booking**.

![](/guides/img/renter-08-booking-confirmed-desktop-b5603da5.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 972; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003; pins: 1 10.4 54.9, 2 9.4 78.9, 3 92.4 76.9")

Money, on the right (below on a phone), shows what you paid and what is owing, part by part, with a **Pay** button when something is open and your receipts. **Price details** opens every line of the price. The steps under **Do this next** show how far along you are: approve the offer, sign and pay, licence and insurance, pick up, return, final statement. A step finished since your last visit ticks over as the bar moves.

## Your rental, step by step

**Your rental, step by step** on your booking opens the walkthrough: the whole rental in four stages, Before pickup, At pickup, On the road and The return.

1. Press **Start the walkthrough** (**Continue** once you have begun). The top shows how many steps are done and which stage you are at.
2. The step to do now is in black at the top. A task opens its page, for example **Add your licence** or **Sign the agreement**, and is ticked once it is done. A step to read (what to bring, where we meet, your own photos, the road rules, what to do if something goes wrong, how to bring the car back) has **Got it**.
3. At pickup, the walk-around: we photograph the car with you and you sign the condition report on your phone. Once done, **See the photo report** opens every photo.
4. Every stage is listed below with its steps, so you can read ahead.

## Upload your licence, selfie and coverage

Do this at least 24 hours before pickup. It takes a few minutes with your phone.

1. On your booking, press **Upload documents** (or **Licence and coverage**).
2. Licence, front: lay the licence on a dark surface with all four corners visible. Press **Take a photo**, or **Choose from my photos** for a photo already on your phone.
3. Licence, back: do the same for the back.
4. Selfie with your licence: hold the licence beside your face, then press **Take selfie**.
5. Coverage for damage to the car: add what your option asks for, then press **Take a photo** or **Choose from my photos** (a PDF works too). Not sure your credit card covers rentals? Use the card coverage checker first.

While your booking still needs them, **Your trips** shows **Upload your licence**, **Upload proof of insurance** and **Check if your credit card covers rentals**, and our request and offer emails link straight to the licence upload.

![](/guides/img/renter-09-verify-desktop-d20f668d.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1232; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/verify; pins: 2 18.5 65.3, 3 50.0 63.6, 4 81.2 63.6, 5 50.0 95.3")

| Your option | What we need |
| --- | --- |
| Option 1, OPCF 27 on your own policy | Your insurer, the policy number and its expiry (after your return date), then two pages: your **pink slip** (the liability insurance card) and the **OPCF 27 endorsement page**, each a PDF or a photo. Send both before you pay: the payment opens once they are in. |
| Option 2, your credit card''s rental coverage | Pay with that card: it must be a credit card (debit and prepaid cards are refused) in your name. Search for your card (the bank and the card''s name) and pick it: the page tells you at once whether it covers this car (the card''s value limit, the kinds of car it leaves out, the most days). Then tick and confirm. Not on the list? Tick **My card is not on the list** and type its name: our team checks it. The card''s benefits document is optional. |
| Option 3, the CarmaCars Protection Plan | Ask for it on your booking; we confirm it once it is active. |

> Good to know: Which cards include rental car coverage? `carmacars.ca/credit-card-rental-coverage` lists them, with each card''s car value limit (MSRP), its longest rental and a link to its guide. Most cards stop at a car priced $65,000 or $85,000, and some of our cars are priced higher. Only your card''s issuer decides a claim: call the number on the back of your card before you rent.

> Tip: A person checks your proof and approves it, or tells you what to fix. The car is handed over only once it is approved. Changing your option replaces the earlier proof. We remind you 48 and 24 hours before pickup while it is missing. We delete licence and face photos 90 days after your rental ends.

## Additional drivers

Each additional driver signs the agreement with their own link.

1. When the agreement is ready, each driver with an email gets their own signing link.
2. On your booking, press **Copy their signing link** to send it yourself, or **Send a new link**.
3. Each driver adds their own licence photos and selfie, like you did.

> Watch out: Signing links expire after 72 hours. A new link ends the older one, so always send the newest.

## Add something to your trip

Until 24 hours before pickup (or the notice an add-on needs), add add-ons from your booking.

1. On your booking, under Add-ons, press **Add something to your trip**.
2. Tick the add-on you want. Its price shows below.
3. Press **Add and pay**. It is charged at once on the card you paid with, and shows on your booking and receipt.
4. A chauffeur needs our confirmation: press **Ask for it**. We confirm it and charge your card then.

No card on file for this booking? The add-on is added and waits for payment: press **Pay for your add-ons** under Add-ons, enter a card and press **Pay**. It is charged at once; that card is not kept.

> Tip: If you cancel, add-ons are refunded like the rest of your booking. Flowers and a chauffeur are not refunded once their notice before pickup has started.

## What to bring to pickup

- Your original licence. A photo is not enough.
- The card you paid with. The deposit is taken on it about an hour before pickup.
- A few minutes to walk around the car with us. We photograph it together.

## Check in yourself (release 28)

From 24 hours before pickup, **Check in yourself** on your booking: take the photos of the car as you get it (pick them all at once from your camera roll: all sides, odometer, fuel gauge, inside, any damage), the odometer and the fuel. If your booking is ready, you are checked in at once; otherwise a team member confirms it. If you do not take the photos, we take them.

**Confirm it is you** is an optional step on the same page: take a photo of your licence and a selfie at that moment. We compare them with the ones on your booking, so the car goes to you and nobody else. You can skip it, and it never holds up your check-in. The photos are deleted with your other licence and face photos, 90 days after your rental ends.

## If we change your coverage (release 35)

If your card does not cover the car, or you ask for the CarmaCars Protection Plan, our team can switch your booking for you. You get an email with what changed and the new total. On an offer you approve the new price. On a booking you have paid, any extra is sent to you as a secure payment link, or you pay it from your booking page. You then do not need to send a card coverage document. If you go back to your card, the booking page asks you to confirm it again.

## Your accident card

Your booking shows your **Accident card**: what to do after an accident, and the coverage of this booking.

- With your own auto policy (OPCF 27): your insurer and policy number, as on the proof you uploaded.
- With your credit card coverage: the card and its coverage provider.
- With the Protection Plan: the provider, the policy number, the claims phone and your plan reference.

Press **Print it** to print the card at its size for the glovebox, or keep the page on your phone.

### Your name and date of birth
Set them in your profile. Once your licence is verified they must match it: a change is sent as a correction request, shown as waiting until our team checks it against your licence.

## If your card does not cover the car

The page says why: the card has no rental car damage coverage, the car is worth more than the card''s limit, the card leaves out this kind of car, or the rental is longer than the card allows. Pick another card from the list, or under "How will the car be covered?" choose **OPCF 27 on my own auto policy** or the Protection Plan.

## Change my protection

How damage to the car is covered can be changed on your booking page, under **Protection**, once you approve the offer and until you return the car.

1. Press **Change my protection**. You see the three options with their prices: your own insurance (OPCF 27), your credit card''s coverage, or the CarmaCars Protection Plan.
2. Credit card coverage: choose your card from our list. It counts only if that card covers this car, and you tick that you will pay with it. Otherwise, OPCF 27: tick that you will upload your policy (the pink slip and the endorsement page). Otherwise, the Protection Plan.
3. The Protection Plan applies at once: pay the difference with **Pay** on your booking. Moving off the Protection Plan needs your proof (a photo or PDF); our team checks it and the change applies once approved. You can withdraw the request while it waits.

During your trip you can add the Protection Plan; your own insurance or card coverage is set before pickup. After damage is reported, the protection stays as it was.

## Sharing your location at pickup and return

With your permission, the CarmaCars app or the website shares where you are with our team only two hours either side of your pickup and your return, so we can meet you. At any other time nothing is taken. Turn it off any time in **Account** > **Profile** > **Location on the live map**.', 'Before pickup', 'Upload your licence and coverage, send driver links, and know what to bring.',
