 email has the same link. <b class="gd-ui">Add to Apple Wallet</b> shows when it is available.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when your offer is ready, before pickup and return, for payments and when we message you, even with CarmaCars closed.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, untick anything you do not want. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> to see one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first: in Safari tap <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. Open CarmaCars from your Home Screen, sign in and turn alerts on in Profile (iOS 16.4 or later).</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Alerts come as well as your emails and texts, never instead of them. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am. Sign-in links and codes never come as alerts.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> and scroll to <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, add a reason if you like, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">We settle anything still open (a rental, a deposit), delete your account and email you within 30 days. Changed your mind before then? Press <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>We keep rental agreements, receipts and tax records as the law requires. Everything else, including your licence and selfie photos, is deleted.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-odometer-and-fuel-at-pickup-and-return" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Odometer and fuel at pickup and return</h2><p class="gd-p">When you check the car in or out yourself:</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Add a photo of the dashboard (the odometer and the fuel gauge). It can come from your camera roll. We read it and ask, for example, &quot;Odometer 45,210 km, fuel 3/4: correct?&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Yes, correct</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">No, I will type it</b> and type the odometer and pick the fuel level.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take a selfie in front of the car with your camera.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">After the return, <b class="gd-ui">Your return: km and fuel</b> on your booking shows the km driven, the km included and any km over, the fuel compared with pickup, and the charge for each. The photo report shows both dashboard photos.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-earn-reward-points" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Earn reward points</h2><p class="gd-p">Review your rental (add a photo for extra points), review us on Google, follow us from your Rewards page, refer a friend, and every rental after your first earns points too. See them all on <b class="gd-ui">Rewards</b>.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-rewards-and-fuel-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Rewards and fuel (release 35)</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Earn points for a photo with your review and for every rental after your first; every way to earn is on your Rewards page.</li><li>A fuel shortfall at the return is priced from the car&#39;s tank and the local pump price, plus a refuelling fee, and checked by our team before any charge.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-thank-the-team" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Thank the team</h2><p class="gd-p">Happy with the service? On your booking after the return, or from the link in the &quot;Returned&quot; email, press <b class="gd-ui">Add a tip for the team</b>: 10, 15 or 20% or any amount, by card. It goes to the people who looked after your rental.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-choose-your-notifications-release-48" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Choose your notifications (release 48)</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Notifications</b> lists each kind of notification we send you, with a switch for <b class="gd-ui">Push</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Email</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Text</b>. A switch is saved the moment you move it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">How often</b>: <b class="gd-ui">Instant</b> sends each one as it happens. <b class="gd-ui">Daily summary</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Weekly summary</b> holds the optional emails and sends them as one email in the morning.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Quiet hours</b>: turn them on and set the times. Optional phone alerts and texts wait until the quiet hours end.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Turn every optional notification off</b> stops them all at once. You still see every message in your portal.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">The kinds under <b class="gd-ui">Always on</b> cannot be switched off: security and sign-in codes, legal and agreement notices, charges and fees, receipts, booking confirmations and changes, pickup and return reminders, and safety messages.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">If a text cannot be sent, the same message comes by email instead, so nothing is lost.</div></li></ol></div></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'rewards', 'chapter', 'after-your-trip', 'CarmaCars Rewards gives you points on every rental. Points come off the rental charge of a later booking, and more points bring a higher tier with perks. Open **Rewards** in the menu.

## What we send you

We email you, and the same message shows under **Account** > **Notifications**:

1. Welcome to CarmaCars Rewards: when your account is made or your first booking is confirmed. How it works, your points and the ways to earn.
2. Points earned: after a rental closes, a review, a referral or your birthday. What earned them, your balance and how far you are from the next tier.
3. A new tier: when you reach Gold, Platinum or Black, with what it gives you.
4. Your free rental day: at Black, with a button that opens a booking with the code already in the promo code box.
5. Before points end: 30 days and 7 days before, and before a free day code ends.
6. Offers you can stop at any time with the unsubscribe link: close to the next tier, points waiting a month after your last rental, the monthly statement on the 1st, and your birthday and holiday rewards.

## Birthday and holiday rewards

From Platinum up, a rental that starts near your birthday or on a holiday weekend costs less: Platinum 10%, Black 20% off the rental charge. The bigger one applies, never both. Sign in before you book and the price shows the line **Birthday reward** or **Holiday reward**.

1. Your birthday comes from your driver''s licence when we have it.
2. Otherwise, on **Rewards** or **Account** > **Profile**, choose the month and type the day (the year is optional), then press **Save my birthday**.
3. The holidays are the Ontario ones: New Year''s Day, Family Day, Good Friday, Victoria Day, Canada Day, Civic Holiday, Labour Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas Day and Boxing Day. The Rewards page lists the next ones with their pickup days.

> Tip: The reward is off the rental charge only, never fees, add-ons, coverage, tax or the deposit, and not on bookings paid by an insurer.', 'Rewards', 'Points, tiers, the emails we send and the birthday and holiday rewards.',
  'CarmaCars Rewards gives you points on every rental. Points come off the rental charge of a later booking, and more points bring a higher tier with perks. Open **Rewards** in the menu.

## What we send you

We email you, and the same message shows under **Account** > **Notifications**:

1. Welcome to CarmaCars Rewards: when your account is made or your first booking is confirmed. How it works, your points and the ways to earn.
2. Points earned: after a rental closes, a review, a referral or your birthday. What earned them, your balance and how far you are from the next tier.
